513 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Sound Mound explanation guide was written to guide you through the phonemes that each Sound Mound references. Within the English Language, there are a lot of words that derive from other languages which make our language difficult to learn, especially for young learners. The goal that I had in mind when creating this resource was to inform educators, parents, guardians, and students on the rules, tips, tricks, and whys of our language, all while providing a visual for students to reference. )
/E (The Sound Mound explanation guide was written to guide you through the phonemes that each Sound Mound references. Within the English Language, there are a lot of words that derive from other languages which make our language difficult to learn, especially for young learners. The goal that I had in mind when creating this resource was to inform educators, parents, guardians, and students on the rules, tips, tricks, and whys of our language, all while providing a visual for students to reference. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
514 0 obj
<<
