515 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This resource is organized by category of graphemes. Each page is labeled with the phoneme that is being targeted. You will find the graphemes correspond to the differentiated Sound Mounds. There are word lists under each phoneme for each grapheme that is being practiced. You can use these guides for dictation activities, phonemic awareness activities, or for decoding activities for students.)
/E (This resource is organized by category of graphemes. Each page is labeled with the phoneme that is being targeted. You will find the graphemes correspond to the differentiated Sound Mounds. There are word lists under each phoneme for each grapheme that is being practiced. You can use these guides for dictation activities, phonemic awareness activities, or for decoding activities for students.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
