540 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The heart       is a visual to help students with words that contain a heart part. A word with a heart part can be a grapheme that has not been introduced yet or a trick grapheme that is irregular. The heart part of a word can be modeled by first mapping out the phonemes of the word, and then heart the trick part of the word with a heart above grapheme. For example, the word said is a trick word where the ai makes the short E sound. This Sound Mound can be helpful for teaching this trick word. )
/E (The heart       is a visual to help students with words that contain a heart part. A word with a heart part can be a grapheme that has not been introduced yet or a trick grapheme that is irregular. The heart part of a word can be modeled by first mapping out the phonemes of the word, and then heart the trick part of the word with a heart above grapheme. For example, the word said is a trick word where the ai makes the short E sound. This Sound Mound can be helpful for teaching this trick word. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
