/T (*When differentiating between a-e and ai, we see ai used with the ending sound of /n/ and /l/ more commonly. However, there are homophones that will use both a-e and ai.)
/E (*When differentiating between a-e and ai, we see ai used with the ending sound of /n/ and /l/ more commonly. However, there are homophones that will use both a-e and ai.)
