/S /H3
/T (Short Vowels go with W: If a short vowel is found after the /w/ phoneme, the w grapheme will be used. \(web, want, wick, went\))
/E (Short Vowels go with W: If a short vowel is found after the /w/ phoneme, the w grapheme will be used. \(web, want, wick, went\))
